OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does Andy Burnham have up his
OL,4,Asleeve as he crashes SNP conference?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is crashing the SNP's
OL,7,Fconference, but without going anywhere
OL,8,Fnear John Swinney's party gathering in
OL,9,FAberdeen.
OL,11,FBy deciding to be in Scotland at the
OL,12,Fsame time he is bound to divert some
OL,13,Fattention from the first minister to
OL,14,Fhimself as prime minister.
OL,16,FHaving said that, Burnham has
OL,17,Finadvertently done Swinney a few
OL,18,Fpolitical favours ahead of the SNP's
OL,19,Fannual get-together.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
