OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does Andy Burnham have up his
OL,4,Asleeve as he crashes SNP conference?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirstly, there was an exchange in the
OL,7,FCommons where the PM appeared to
OL,8,Facknowledge circumstances in which
OL,9,Fanother independence referendum would
OL,10,Fbe legitimate.
